* "Ah, Miss" – Anthony, Johanna, Beggar Woman
* "Johanna" – Anthony
* "Pirelli's Miracle Elixir" – Tobias, Todd, Mrs. Lovett, Crowd
* "The Contest (Part 1): Shaving Scene" – Pirelli
* "The Contest (Part 2): Tooth-Pulling Scene" <sup>†&</sup> – Pirelli, Tobias
