* "A Little Priest" – Todd, Lovett
{{col-break}}

; Act II:
* "God, That's Good!" – Tobias, Mrs. Lovett, Todd, Customers
* "Johanna (Act 2 Sequence)" – Anthony, Todd, Beggar Woman, Johanna
* "By the Sea" – Mrs. Lovett and Todd
* "Wigmaker Sequence"/"The Ballad of Sweeney Todd: '...La la la' (reprise 4)"/"The Letter" – Todd, Anthony, Quintet*
* "[[Not While I'm Around (song)|Not While I'm Around]]" – Tobias, Mrs. Lovett
