**"The Judge's Return" – Judge Turpin, Todd
**"The Ballad of Sweeney Todd: '...La la la'" (reprise 6) – Chorus*
**"Final Scene" –  Lovett, Todd
**"The Barber and His Wife" (reprise) – Todd, Tobias

; Epilogue:
* "The Ballad of Sweeney Todd: '...La la la'" (reprise 7) – Company, Todd, Lovett (Full Cast)
